		{
			title: "A Sugary Diet"
			x: 7.25d
			y: -1.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dSo the boss of Candyland is Cotton Candor, also known as the Sweet Giant."
				""
				"&5He is... quite a character. Dangerous."
				""
				"&dHe used to run some of the FOP business campus restaurants. He leaned the menu heavily on sweets and carb heavy dishes, with little in the way of fruits, veggies, etc."
				""
				"&5Those things are fine...in moderation. Yeah, a bit odd to say given you are in a dimension made entirely of candy, but I'm pretty sure any of us staying more than a few days in that world would end up in a really bad state."
				""
				"&dIf it wasn't all digital, you mean. But yeah... he pushed a really rough menu on everyone, using his saccrine sweet nature to push folks into a sugar addiction."
				""
				"&5His ability to spread his 'diet' so well got him a place in the FOP Game Server, in the 'food' world slot."
			]
			dependencies: ["73F9AA5E1F5B7DE1"]
			id: "474C4726293EECDB"
			tasks: [{
				id: "13ED6F12DCB16CF8"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
