			x: 9.25d
			y: -1.5d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5Before anything, you should make a Treat Bag with the various candies you can find in Candyland."
				""
				"&dYou'll also need a lot of prep for either way you want to handle Cotton Candor. He's a very tough boss to face."
				""
				"&5You'll want to either collect a lot of sweet foods, or a lot of awesome staves from Advent of Ascension."
				""
				"&dYou'll see why."
			]
