		{
			title: "Savoring the Sweet Flavor "
			x: 10.75d
			y: -2.25d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&5Got your Treat Bag? Got a lot of staves? What, you don't?"
				""
				"&dCotton Candor is immune to nearly every type of damage, Bandit. Except to staves. The magic of AoA staves is special, and can get past his cloudy sugar exterior."
				""
				"&5You can summon Cotton Candor by eating that Treat Bag anywhere in Candyland. Deprived of a favorite treat, he will appear and begin lobbing explosives at you. While he does, his shoes will change colors regularly."
				""
				"&dAnd thats the key to defeating him. Each color has a set of staves that will work. Wind for White, Fire or Baron for Red, Poison or Noxious for Green, Water for Blue, and Wither for Grey."
				""
				"&5Managing to defeat Cotton Candor can get you some Candy Armor, candy weapons, etc."
			]
			dependencies: ["20D2E665D8CBE3BF"]
			id: "54D8A02349AD1A5E"
