		{
			title: "To the Sweet Smelling Land"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "diamond"
			description: [
				"&5Gardencia is the world slot reserved for garden like worlds. "
				""
				"&dWorlds with vast arrays of florals. Including the fauna. Flowers, everywhere. The smells can be intoxicating, lovely, and dangerous all at the same time."
				""
				"&5Beautiful and deadly, a common combination. To get there, Bandit, you'll need to bring some farming equipment to Precasia."
				""
				"&dSome dirt, a hoe, and some Carrots. And a Blank Realmstone too, of course."
				""
				"&5And every farmer's trusty tool, a sword. At least in this game server. See, you'll need to grow a Carrot crop to full, then toss that Blank Realmstone onto it."
				""
				"&dIt'll summon an ancient carrot... or something. It's weird, let's just put it that way. Kill the carrot, get the Gardencia realmstone."
			]
			dependencies: ["24052A5E15772F3E"]
			id: "3779CFE188352F70"
			tasks: [{
