			title: "The Flower Garden"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Gardencia's current world is made up of hundreds of flower covered islands floating in an endless sea."
				""
				"&dWow those flowers are huge. They really found a good planet this time. Makes me sad."
				""
				"&5Agreed, sis. Agreed. Okay Bandit, be careful when exploring. The creatures here will most likely be able to heal if its raining."
				""
				"&dAnd you know how much it can rain in the FOP Game server..."
			]
			dependencies: ["3779CFE188352F70"]
