			description: [
				"&5If you've chosen to fight Vinocorne, you'll need to find one of the Vinocorne Altars. These are located in Floro Castles, large dark structures scattered around Gardencia."
				""
				"&dJust take that pile of Petals and Right Click it onto the Altar to get Vinocorne's attention."
